Transformed points: [[0.7071067811865476 -0.7071067811865476] [0.7071067811865476 0.7071067811865476] [-0.7071067811865476 0.7071067811865476] [-0.7071067811865476 -0.7071067811865476]]
```
You can then use the transformed coordinates to update your points as needed.

