To dynamically generate a poster using PHP, you will need to use an image manipulation library like GD or Imagick. Here's an example code snippet that demonstrates how you can use the GD library to create a poster:
```php
// Create a new image
$image = imagecreatetruecolor(800, 600);
// Set the background color
$bg_color = imagecolorallocate($image, 255, 255, 255);
imagefill($image, 0, 0, $bg_color);
// Load the artist's photo
$artist_photo = imagecreatefromjpeg('path/to/artist/photo.jpg');
// Resize the photo to fit the poster
$artist_photo_resized = imagescale($artist_photo, 200, 200);
// Paste the artist's photo onto the poster
