The formula for calculating a percentage of a number is:
percentage = (part / whole) * 100
Where "part" is the portion of the whole that you want to find the percentage of.
Here is a Java code implementation for finding 10% of 180 using this formula:
```
double whole = 180;
double part = 10;
double percentage = (part / whole) * 100;
