The pharmaceutical industry in India has been growing steadily over the past 5 years. The top 10 pharmaceutical companies in India reported a combined revenue of INR 2,50,000 crore in 2020, up from INR 1,70,000 crore in 2016. This represents a compound annual growth rate (CAGR) of 8.1%. The industry has also been a major employer, creating over 5 lakh jobs in 2020.
